sequenceDiagram
    participant GHA as GitHub Actions — 10 min cron
    participant SRV as serve.mjs — /tick
    participant IDX as index.mjs — tick
    participant PX as price.mjs
    participant G as The Graph
    participant GW as Circle Gateway
    participant R as refresh.mjs — paid LLM fan-out
    participant SA as StrategyAgent
    participant SC as StrategyController
    participant H as TrancheJITHook
    participant PP as TranchePipeModule

    GHA->>IDX: scheduled tick
    SRV->>IDX: POST /tick — frontend Run agent check
    IDX->>PX: attempt automatic oracle push
    PX->>PX: skip when price fresh (< 80% of maxStaleness) or market closed
    PX->>GW: pay nanoprice seller when stale
    GW-->>PX: quote + paymentRef
    PX->>H: oracle.updatePrice(mid, marketStatus, sourceTimestamp, paymentRef)
    IDX->>G: refresh market model — pools, volatility, fees, IL sweep
    IDX->>H: perceive — params, bounds, quoteState, oracle, composition
    IDX->>IDX: economicAudit + deterministic regime clamps — model.mjs
    IDX->>R: verdict older than AGENT_LLM_REFRESH_SECONDS (6h)?
    R->>R: paid call — x402 / Circle Gateway, hash-bound verdict
    R-->>IDX: fresh verdict or deterministic fallback
    IDX->>SA: submitParams / submitRebalance within PARAM_CLAMPS ∩ live bounds
    SA->>SC: forward
    SC->>H: setParams / setBaseFee / setQuotingEnabled
    SC->>PP: rebalanceSwap(equityOut, amountIn, minOut, deadline)
    Note over IDX,H: hooks still enforce per-swap gates — oracle, EV, risk budget, active pool
